# Incident Response Matrix

| Phase | Focus Area | Example Action |
|---|---|---|
| Preparation | Controls and readiness | Validate MFA, backups, and escalation paths |
| Detection | Monitoring | Review authentication anomalies and endpoint alerts |
| Analysis | Triage | Identify scope, affected systems, and impact |
| Containment | Isolation | Remove access, block malicious flow, isolate affected assets |
| Eradication | Remediation | Remove persistence, patch systems, reset credentials |
| Recovery | Restore service | Bring systems back online and validate integrity |
| Lessons Learned | Improvement | Update detection logic and response procedures |

This matrix supports a mature defense narrative and aligns with applied cyber operations thinking.
